<title>USA: Michael Foods former CEO quits board.</title>
<headline>Michael Foods former CEO quits board.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Michael Foods Inc said former chief executive officer Richard Olson has resigned from its board of directors for personal reasons, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Olson served as the company's CEO from 1987 to 1993 and has been a director since its formation in 1987.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
